ode>: Double quoted string. Specifying this will delete all events\nassociated with a user.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>Examples:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deleting all events in a time range:\n<code>eventTime &gt; \"2012-04-23T18:25:43.511Z\" eventTime &lt; \"2012-04-23T18:30:43.511Z\"<\/code><\/li>\n<li>Deleting specific eventType in time range:\n<code>eventTime &gt; \"2012-04-23T18:25:43.511Z\" eventType = \"detail-page-view\"<\/code><\/li>\n<li>Deleting all events for a specific visitor:\n<code>visitorId = \"visitor1024\"<\/code><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The filtering fields are assumed to have an implicit AND.<\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blank\">string<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"optionalArgs","description":"","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.array.php\" target=\"_blank\">array<\/a>"],"optional":false,"nullable":null},{"name":"optionalArgs.force\n","description":"","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.boolean.php\" target=\"_blank\">bool<\/a>"],"optional":null,"nullable":null},{"name":"optionalArgs.retrySettings\n","description":"","types":["|"],"optional":null,"nullable":null}],"exceptions":[{"type":{},"description":{}}],"returns":[{"types":["<a href=\"https:\/\/googleapis.github.io\/gax-php\/v1.7.1\/Google\/ApiCore\/OperationResponse.html\" target=\"_blank\">Google\\ApiCore\\OperationResponse<\/a>"],"description":""}]},{"id":"importUserEvents","type":"instance","name":"importUserEvents","source":"Retail\/src\/V2\/Gapic\/UserEventServiceGapicClient.php#L532","description":"<p>Bulk import of User events. Request processing might be\nsynchronous. Events that already exist are skipped.<\/p>","examples":[],"resources":[],"params":[{"name":"parent","description":"<p>Required. <code>projects\/1234\/locations\/global\/catalogs\/default_catalog<\/code><\/p>","types":["<a href=\"http:\/\/php.net\/manual\/en\/language.types.string.php\" target=\"_blan